This file is about.def, from which is created about.c.
It implements the lsh builtin "about" and the LSL integration of lsh.

Copyright (C) 2026 LuxOS Team

This file is part of lsh (Lux Shell), a fork of GNU Bash.

lsh is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the
